  "coordinate_oracle": "IFC millimetres convert to metres. Rigid local-to-world inverse restores planar local coordinates. Filled outer square4x4 minus square1x1 has area15; mixed solid square has area16. Every actual triangle clipped against hole has zero positive intersection area.",
  "presentation_oracle": "IFC4 direct fill style and IFC2X3 presentation-style assignment yield Cyan fill/color. Fast-first intentionally retains initial gray meshes without material_name and delivers Cyan via actual color-update events; symbolic fills carry Cyan. Other modes retain Cyan mesh/material fields. Horizontal and vertical products retained; footprint-only type excluded. Mixed annotation keeps symbolic text and curves beside its mesh.",
  "checker_correction": "Initial checker incorrectly required retained material_name in fast-first mode. Actual baseline and candidate retain initial gray mesh fields and emit the later Cyan color update. The corrected checker asserts both halves of that existing contract; no production code changed.",
